From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anton Palgunov <toxblh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:20:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/99] v8: e2k: add target backend skeleton copied from
 loong64

Copy the loong64 code generator, macro assembler, builtins, TurboFan
backend, regexp assembler, deoptimizer and frame constants to e2k
directories with classes, macros and include guards renamed. The
instruction encoding is still loong64; nothing here is executable yet.
The simulator, Sparkplug, Maglev and Liftoff parts are not copied. The
disassembler is a stub that prints "unimplemented" and the instruction
cache flush uses __builtin___clear_cache.
